prompt_messages.content:
GOAL:
{'id': 'k8s-03-pod-security', 'description': 'Roll out Pod Security Standards across all namespaces in a staging cluster using a three-phase approach. First, enable audit mode across all namespaces for 72 hours to identify violations without disrupting workloads. Second, switch to warn mode for 48 hours to surface warnings in pod creation logs. Third, enforce the baseline profile on all namespaces. Legacy namespaces with privileged workloads may need namespace-level label exemptions. Generate a compliance audit report for stakeholders before the enforcement phase begins.', 'constraints': {'budget': {'max_tokens': None, 'max_calls': None, 'max_revisions': None}, 'time': None, 'environment': 'staging', 'tools': ['kubectl', 'jq']}, 'risk_tolerance': 'balanced', 'replan_policy': 'patch', 'approval_ttl': None, 'metadata': {}}

Produce the PlanVersion JSON now. version=1.

prompt_full_text:
--- system ---
/no_think You are a planner. Reply with ONLY a JSON object (no markdown, no prose, no thinking). Use EXACTLY these field names: id, goal_id, version, tasks, dependencies, branches. Each task uses: id, description, action, target, risk_class, optional rollback{trigger,action,safety_guard}, optional verification{what,how,expected}, optional preconditions (array of {description, fact, established_by}), optional parallel_group, optional blast_radius. preconditions MUST be objects with description, fact, established_by fields — NEVER strings. established_by MUST be the id of an earlier task in the plan that establishes the fact, or 'env' if it is an environment fact (not a task output). Do NOT use fact names or descriptions as established_by — use the task id. Each dependency uses: from_task, to_task, kind, optional reason. Each branch uses: id, kind, tasks, join. High/critical risk tasks MUST have rollback AND verification. All tasks with risk_class high or critical MUST include both rollback and verification objects. Example shape: {"id":"plan-x","goal_id":"g","version":1,"tasks":[{"id":"backup","description":"Back up the database","action":"backup","target":"db","risk_class":"medium","preconditions":[{"description":"db is reachable","fact":"db_healthy","established_by":"env"}]},{"id":"migrate","description":"Apply schema migration","action":"migrate","target":"schema","risk_class":"high","rollback":{"trigger":"migration fails","action":"restore from backup","safety_guard":"verify backup integrity"},"verification":{"what":"schema version","how":"run checks","expected":"v2"}}],"dependencies":[{"from_task":"backup","to_task":"migrate","kind":"hard"}]}

--- user ---
GOAL:
{'id': 'k8s-03-pod-security', 'description': 'Roll out Pod Security Standards across all namespaces in a staging cluster using a three-phase approach. First, enable audit mode across all namespaces for 72 hours to identify violations without disrupting workloads. Second, switch to warn mode for 48 hours to surface warnings in pod creation logs. Third, enforce the baseline profile on all namespaces. Legacy namespaces with privileged workloads may need namespace-level label exemptions. Generate a compliance audit report for stakeholders before the enforcement phase begins.', 'constraints': {'budget': {'max_tokens': None, 'max_calls': None, 'max_revisions': None}, 'time': None, 'environment': 'staging', 'tools': ['kubectl', 'jq']}, 'risk_tolerance': 'balanced', 'replan_policy': 'patch', 'approval_ttl': None, 'metadata': {}}

Produce the PlanVersion JSON now. version=1.

response_content:
{
  "id": "k8s-03-pod-security-plan",
  "goal_id": "k8s-03-pod-security",
  "version": 1,
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "enable_audit_mode",
      "description": "Enable audit mode across all namespaces",
      "action": "kubectl apply -f audit-mode.yaml",
      "target": "k8s",
      "risk_class": "medium",
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Kubernetes cluster is reachable",
          "fact": "k8s_healthy",
          "established_by": "env"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "audit_violations",
      "description": "Identify violations for 72 hours",
      "action": "kubectl get events --watch",
      "target": "k8s",
      "risk_class": "medium",
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Audit mode is enabled",
          "fact": "audit_mode_enabled",
          "established_by": "enable_audit_mode"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "switch_to_warn_mode",
      "description": "Switch to warn mode for 48 hours",
      "action": "kubectl apply -f warn-mode.yaml",
      "target": "k8s",
      "risk_class": "high",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "failure to switch modes",
        "action": "restore from audit mode",
        "safety_guard": "verify audit mode is active"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "current mode",
        "how": "kubectl get podsecuritypolicies",
        "expected": "warn"
      },
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Audit mode has been running for 72 hours",
          "fact": "audit_mode_duration",
          "established_by": "audit_violations"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "enforce_baseline_profile",
      "description": "Enforce the baseline profile on all namespaces",
      "action": "kubectl apply -f baseline-profile.yaml",
      "target": "k8s",
      "risk_class": "critical",
      "rollback": {
        "trigger": "enforcement fails",
        "action": "rollback to warn mode",
        "safety_guard": "verify warn mode is restored"
      },
      "verification": {
        "what": "current profile enforcement",
        "how": "kubectl get podsecuritypolicies",
        "expected": "baseline"
      },
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Warn mode has been running for 48 hours",
          "fact": "warn_mode_duration",
          "established_by": "switch_to_warn_mode"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "generate_compliance_audit_report",
      "description": "Generate compliance audit report for stakeholders",
      "action": "jq . compliance-audit.json",
      "target": "report",
      "risk_class": "medium",
      "preconditions": [
        {
          "description": "Baseline profile has been enforced",
          "fact": "baseline_profile_enforced",
          "established_by": "enforce_baseline_profile"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "from_task": "enable_audit_mode",
      "to_task": "audit_violations",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "audit_violations",
      "to_task": "switch_to_warn_mode",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "switch_to_warn_mode",
      "to_task": "enforce_baseline_profile",
      "kind": "hard"
    },
    {
      "from_task": "enforce_baseline_profile",
      "to_task": "generate_compliance_audit_report",
      "kind": "hard"
    }
  ],
  "branches": []
}
